<title>USA: Reliance Steel realizes gain on land sale.</title>
<headline>Reliance Steel realizes gain on land sale.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliance Steel &amp; Aluminum Co said Tuesday it sold its Santa Clara, Calif., land and building and realized a pre-tax gain of about $1 million.</p>
<p>The company said its Santa Clara operations will be moved to a new facility in Union City, Calif., which is currently under construction.</p>
<p>Reliance said it is renting its Santa Clara facility from the new owner until its new facility is ready for occupancy, which is currently expected during the first quarter of 1998.</p>
</text>
